Package: decontamSensitivity
Type: Package
Title: Sensitivity Diagnostics for 'decontam' Thresholds
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      "Soyeon", "Kim",
      email = "kim.soyeon.bio@gmail.com",
      role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
  )
Author: Soyeon Kim [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Soyeon Kim <kim.soyeon.bio@gmail.com>
Description: Evaluates how contaminant-classification thresholds affect
    biological-sample read retention, negative-control depletion, feature
    retention, sample dropout, and the taxonomy of newly flagged features.
    It consumes scores produced by the 'decontam' package and provides a
    diagnostic layer; it does not reimplement contaminant identification or
    select an optimal threshold automatically.
